{
  "name": "Reseñas UGC (captura + correos)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "reviews",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "rv-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook reseñas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "reviews",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Web Electrificarte (x-electrificarte-secret)"
        }
      },
      "notes": "La Production URL de este nodo va en Vercel como N8N_REVIEWS_URL."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "tableId": "reviews",
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "first_name",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.firstName }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "last_name",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.lastName }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "email",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.email }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "phone",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.phone }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "rating",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.rating }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "body",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.body }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "car_slug",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.carSlug }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "car_sanity_id",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.carSanityId }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "car_brand",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.carBrand }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "car_model",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.carModel }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "car_year",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.carYear }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "car_color",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.carColor }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "car_version",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.carVersion }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "photos",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.photos }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "source",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.source }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "status",
              "fieldValue": "pendiente"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "rv-supabase",
      "name": "Guardar reseña (pendiente)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Supabase (service_role)"
        }
      },
      "notes": "status='pendiente' SIEMPRE: nada se publica sin que Francisco lo apruebe en el dashboard."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.resend.com/emails",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "keypair",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "from",
              "value": "Electrificarte <no-reply@electrificarte.com>"
            },
            {
              "name": "to",
              "value": "francisco@electrificarte.com"
            },
            {
              "name": "subject",
              "value": "Nueva reseña por moderar"
            },
            {
              "name": "html",
              "value": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <title>Electrificarte</title>\n</head>\n<!--\n  RESEÑAS: aviso interno a Francisco para moderar.\n  Lee del nodo \"Webhook reseñas\": body.rating, body, carBrand, carModel, carYear, firstName,\n  lastName, email, phone, photos.\n\n  GENERADO por scripts/gen-emails.mjs (sistema de diseño v1). No editar a mano: cambiá el\n  generador y corré  node scripts/gen-emails.mjs && node scripts/gen-waitlist-reviews-workflows.mjs\n  Todo dato que escribe el usuario va escapado para HTML.\n-->\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f7f6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Hay una reseña esperando tu revisión.</div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f2f7f6;\">\n    <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 12px;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:0 4px 20px;\">\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n            <td><picture><source srcset=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/brand/email-wordmark-niebla.png\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"><img src=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/brand/email-wordmark-tinta.png\" alt=\"Electrificarte\" width=\"218\" height=\"16\" style=\"display:block;border:0;width:218px;height:16px;\"></picture></td>\n            <td align=\"right\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#0f1716;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;\">Uso interno</span></td>\n          </tr></table>\n        </td></tr>\n\n        <tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dfe4e4;border-radius:12px;padding:36px 32px 32px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0f1716;\">Nueva reseña por revisar</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#495251;\">Llegó una reseña nueva. <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;\">No está publicada</strong>: aparece en el sitio solo cuando la apruebes en el dashboard.</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;background:#caefea;border-radius:12px;\">\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:20px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#0f1716;\">{{ String(([$('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.carBrand, $('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.carModel, $('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.carYear].filter(Boolean).join(' ')) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') || 'Auto sin indicar' }}</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0f1716;\">{{ '★'.repeat(Math.max(0, Math.min(5, Number($('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.rating) || 0))) + '☆'.repeat(5 - Math.max(0, Math.min(5, Number($('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.rating) || 0))) }} <span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;\">{{ String(($('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.rating) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}/5</span></p>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\">\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:4px 0 4px 16px;border-left:2px solid #1d605b;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#0f1716;white-space:pre-line;\">{{ String(($('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.body) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;border-top:1px solid #dfe4e4;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Quién la dejó</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.firstName) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }} {{ String(($('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.lastName) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Email</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.email) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Teléfono</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.phone) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') || 'No indicó' }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Fotos</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ Math.floor((($('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.photos) || []).length / 2) }}</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#495251;font-size:14px;\">Revisa que el contenido sea sobre el auto y que sea apropiado antes de publicarla.</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0;\"><tr>\n  <td style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#1d605b;\">\n    <a href=\"https://dashboard.electrificarte.com/admin/resenas\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;\">Moderar en el dashboard &rarr;</a>\n  </td>\n</tr></table>\n        </td></tr>\n\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:24px 4px 0;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#687170;\">\n          Aviso interno generado automáticamente por n8n.\n        </td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "rv-mail-francisco",
      "name": "Correo por moderar (Francisco)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        540,
        180
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Resend (Authorization Bearer)"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Asigná la credencial Resend. El html va en modo expresión (empieza con '=')."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.resend.com/emails",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "keypair",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "from",
              "value": "Electrificarte <no-reply@electrificarte.com>"
            },
            {
              "name": "to",
              "value": "={{ $('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.email }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "subject",
              "value": "Recibimos tu reseña"
            },
            {
              "name": "html",
              "value": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <title>Electrificarte</title>\n</head>\n<!--\n  RESEÑAS: agradecimiento a quien dejó la reseña.\n  Lee del nodo \"Webhook reseñas\": body.firstName, carBrand, carModel (opcionales).\n\n  GENERADO por scripts/gen-emails.mjs (sistema de diseño v1). No editar a mano: cambiá el\n  generador y corré  node scripts/gen-emails.mjs && node scripts/gen-waitlist-reviews-workflows.mjs\n  Todo dato que escribe el usuario va escapado para HTML.\n-->\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f7f6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Recibimos tu reseña y la estamos revisando.</div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f2f7f6;\">\n    <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 12px;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:0 4px 20px;\">\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n            <td><picture><source srcset=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/brand/email-wordmark-niebla.png\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"><img src=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/brand/email-wordmark-tinta.png\" alt=\"Electrificarte\" width=\"218\" height=\"16\" style=\"display:block;border:0;width:218px;height:16px;\"></picture></td>\n            \n          </tr></table>\n        </td></tr>\n\n        <tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dfe4e4;border-radius:12px;padding:36px 32px 32px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0f1716;\">Gracias por compartir tu experiencia</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#495251;\">Hola <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;\">{{ String(($('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.firstName) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</strong>, recibimos tu reseña del <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;\">{{ String(([$('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.carBrand, $('Webhook reseñas').item.json.body.carModel].filter(Boolean).join(' ')) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') || 'auto' }}</strong>. La revisamos antes de publicarla, para asegurarnos de que todo esté en orden.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#495251;\">Opiniones como la tuya ayudan a que la próxima persona elija bien su auto electrificado. Gracias por tomarte el tiempo.</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0;\"><tr>\n  <td style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#1d605b;\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/marcas\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;\">Ver el catálogo &rarr;</a>\n  </td>\n</tr></table>\n        </td></tr>\n\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:24px 4px 0;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#687170;\">\n          Electrificarte, marketplace de autos electrificados en Chile.<br>\n          <a href=\"https://www.electrificarte.com\" style=\"color:#1d605b;text-decoration:underline;\">electrificarte.com</a> y <a href=\"mailto:contacto@electrificarte.com\" style=\"color:#1d605b;text-decoration:underline;\">contacto@electrificarte.com</a>\n        </td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
